In terminal chat: /models, /model <name>, /clear, /help, /exit.
GGUFs: ~/Projects/AI/models/llm; llama.cpp cache: ~/Projects/AI/models/.llama-cache.
No Ollama installation or external model cache is used.

Workspace: ~/Projects/AI by default; override with exported AI_HOME.
You can run `ai` from Fish, Bash or a desktop terminal: Bash handles the script.
System dependencies are listed in comments at the top, never installed with pacman.
